        <caption>
          <formatted-text>
            <run fontcolor='#000000' fontname='Benton Sans Book'>Bottom 30 of 77 districts by CoV%, colored by resource zone (13 zones defined for this analysis by grouping districts along Nepal&apos;s Mountain-Hill-Terai physiographic gradient). Eastern Terai, Madhesh Terai and Far- West Hills cluster districts are at the most-stable end of the ranking. Full results for all 77 districts are available in the underlying dataset.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
          </formatted-text>
        </caption>
